    "detailed_description": "Join Lynx on an adventure to rescue a princess and collect 9 souls. A retro-action RPG filled with puzzles, dungeons, and treasure.<br><br>What happens when a sleeping kitty cat follows a mouse into his hole?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986370/extras/00df188e8995eeb5855accdcd28ddd8b.poster.avif?t=1705782877\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986370/extras/00df188e8995eeb5855accdcd28ddd8b.webm?t=1705782877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986370/extras/00df188e8995eeb5855accdcd28ddd8b.mp4?t=1705782877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986370/extras/43e603a92fe7991f558877464e539272.poster.avif?t=1705782877\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986370/extras/43e603a92fe7991f558877464e539272.webm?t=1705782877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986370/extras/43e603a92fe7991f558877464e539272.mp4?t=1705782877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Plunged into a magical land where dogs have taken over, Lynx must win back the mythical artifacts that will lead him to Princess Grizelda. Granny Tortoise sets you on a journey to defeat the soul guardians and rescue Whinnie and Ricky Mouse, Rascal the Racoon, Herb the Sheep, and more. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986370/extras/a7d9dc9f1d6c653c0aea884242fc84e6.poster.avif?t=1705782877\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986370/extras/a7d9dc9f1d6c653c0aea884242fc84e6.webm?t=1705782877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986370/extras/a7d9dc9f1d6c653c0aea884242fc84e6.mp4?t=1705782877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986370/extras/be0acddeb9bc5dbc28461edc71d1dea1.poster.avif?t=1705782877\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986370/extras/be0acddeb9bc5dbc28461edc71d1dea1.webm?t=1705782877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986370/extras/be0acddeb9bc5dbc28461edc71d1dea1.mp4?t=1705782877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Inspired by classic pixel RPG games like Zelda, Kings Quest, Final Fantasy, and more, rediscover the nostalgia of 1980 &amp; 90s adventure games. Help kitties in real life, and consider donating to your local animal shelter or ASPCA. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986370/extras/a9110731d224eafc560c546cab2fbe18.poster.avif?t=1705782877\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986370/extras/a9110731d224eafc560c546cab2fbe18.webm?t=1705782877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986370/extras/a9110731d224eafc560c546cab2fbe18.mp4?t=1705782877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986370/extras/edbab1ddf45d23d73694f477e630f26d.poster.avif?t=1705782877\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986370/extras/edbab1ddf45d23d73694f477e630f26d.webm?t=1705782877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986370/extras/edbab1ddf45d23d73694f477e630f26d.mp4?t=1705782877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
